        "original_id": "7c15505f-6855-53ab-b0c8-d2abf51c2561",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Being Human (UK TV series)\n- People: Andrea Riseborough, Russell Tovey, Guy Flanagan\n- Characters: Annie Sawyer, George Sands, John Mitchell\n- Topics: Supernatural comedy-drama television\n\nFacts:\n- Andrea Louise Riseborough was born on 20 November 1981 and is an English stage and film actress.\n- Being Human is a British supernatural comedy-drama television series.\n- The pilot episode of Being Human starred Andrea Riseborough as Annie Sawyer, a ghost.\n- The pilot episode of Being Human starred Russell Tovey as George Sands, a werewolf.\n- The pilot episode of Being Human starred Guy Flanagan as John Mitchell, a vampire.\n- Annie Sawyer, George Sands, and John Mitchell share accommodation and try to live a normal life while blending in with ordinary humans.",
